# Line endings are fixed whatever core.autocrlf says (Windows: autocrlf=true would
# turn bin/brg into CRLF and bash would refuse it; cmd.exe needs CRLF in .cmd).
# brg init copies bin/ and template/ into projects byte for byte.
* text=auto
bin/brg text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
template/* text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
bin/brg-global text eol=lf
